  "title": "Hearty Smoky Venezuelan Fish Skewers",
  "description": "A pescatarian friendly dish featuring charred fish, molten pistachio paste, and caramelized flavors, inspired by Venezuelan cuisine. This adventurous recipe is perfect for those looking to try something new.",
