  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread fish fillets onto wooden skewers.",
    "In a bowl, mix together pistachio paste, olive oil, lime juice, garlic, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture onto both sides of the fish skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "While the fish is cooking, caramelize the pistachio paste in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Serve the fish skewers with the caramelized pistachio paste spooned over the top.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately.",
    "Let the skewers rest for a few minutes before serving."
